"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2023-07-25T14:48:55Z","milestone":{"title":"2.0.x"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/1650317749","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/10142#issuecomment-1650317749","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/10142","id":1650317749,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCX5JB85iXdm1","user":{"login":"tmrlvi","id":3341739,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDE3Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3341739?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi","html_url":"https://github.com/tmrlvi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-07-25T18:17:22Z","updated_at":"2023-07-25T18:23:33Z","body":"Found the culprit. In the for loop that fills the literals, you take the right value from parameters only if you havn't seen this parameter, but regardless, always update the `replacement_expressions`. So, value retains the value of the previous parameter, but then updates the current parameter.\r\n```\r\n            if parameter in self.literal_execute_params:\r\n                if escaped_name not in replacement_expressions:\r\n                    value = parameters.pop(name)\r\n\r\n                replacement_expressions[\r\n                    escaped_name\r\n                ] = self.render_literal_bindparam(\r\n                    parameter,\r\n                    render_literal_value=value,\r\n                )\r\n```\r\n(Taken from the module [`sqlalchemy.sql.compiler`](https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/blob/9fc027b182483ce465c476757b2fd469bb54ae46/lib/sqlalchemy/sql/compiler.py#L2081))\r\n \r\nAll in all, it looks like a mistake in indentation.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/1650317749/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"tmrlvi","id":3341739,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDE3Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3341739?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi","html_url":"https://github.com/tmrlvi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tmrlvi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/1650341918","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/10142#issuecomment-1650341918","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/10142","id":1650341918,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCX5JB85iXjge","user":{"login":"tmrlvi","id":3341739,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDE3Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.git